---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Pricing">
  <div class="container page-hero"><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="简单透明">Simple, transparent pricing</div><h1 data-zh="先试 7 天。">Start with seven days.</h1><p class="lead" data-zh="试用期间无需自己的 API Key。喜欢它，再决定是否等待终身版开放。">Try hosted AI without bringing a key. Decide later whether the planned lifetime license fits you.</p></div>
  <section class="container section" style="padding-top:20px"><div class="grid-3"><div class="pricing-card featured"><h3 data-zh="免费体验">Free trial</h3><div class="price">$0</div><p data-zh="从邮箱验证成功起连续 7 天。">Seven consecutive days from email verification.</p><ul class="list"><li data-zh="每天最多 30 次生成">Up to 30 generations per day</li><li data-zh="每次包含三种回复风格">Three styles in every generation</li><li data-zh="无需自己的 API Key">No personal API key needed</li><li data-zh="无需信用卡">No credit card</li></ul><a class="button" href="/login" data-zh="开始免费体验">Start free trial</a></div><div class="pricing-card grid-span-2"><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="尚未开放购买">Purchase not open yet</div><h3 style="margin-top:12px" data-zh="终身许可证">Lifetime license</h3><div class="price">$10 <small style="font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0" data-zh="早鸟计划价">planned early bird</small></div><p data-zh="未来计划原价 $15。一次性购买软件使用权，计划支持最多两台设备。">Planned regular price: $15. One-time software license, with up to two devices planned.</p><ul class="list"><li data-zh="使用自己的 DeepSeek API Key">Bring your own DeepSeek API key</li><li data-zh="软件不限制每日生成次数">No software daily generation cap</li><li data-zh="你自行承担 DeepSeek API 费用">You pay your own DeepSeek API usage</li></ul><p class="notice" data-zh="重要：买断价格不包含终身免费 AI API 调用。支付尚未上线，目前无法购买。">Important: the license does not include free lifetime AI API calls. Payments have not launched, so purchases are not available.</p><span class="button muted" data-zh="即将开放购买">Coming soon</span></div></div></section>
</Base>
